3. Solve $ 2 \leq \frac{99}{x} < 3 $ to find $ 33 < x \leq 49.5 $.  
4. Count integer values of $ x $ in $ 34 \leq x \leq 49 $, yielding $ 49 - 34 + 1 = 16 $.  
5. Confirm no solutions exist for $ x \leq 9 $ (as verified by testing small $ x $ values).
</think>
